    "note": "root at the origin, feet on y=0; Blender -Y forward exported to glTF +Z"
  },
  "notes": "Story-cutscene clips on human_shared (bone names/rolls identical to every lf_civilian_*/lf_squad_* GLB, so Godot tracks differ only by the '<asset>_rig/' prefix). 30 fps; loops have identical first/last frames. Locomotion loops are in place with planted feet sliding back at exactly groundSpeed_mps (backstep: negative = walking backwards). Travel one-shots (halt, squeeze, stumble) are in place: move the node along rootPath_m (metres travelled, every 0.1 s) and the planted feet stay put. Acting one-shots with a short step (support, collapse, catch, hide, offer) keep the root still and end with the body displaced by endOffset_m; their *_hold loops keep that offset. Seated clips (sit, sit_down end, drink, show_wrist, talk_seated) assume a 0.45 m seat with the hips 0.36 m behind the root (seat_offset_m). Props: parent cup/lantern to PropR (hand_r, grip point in the right fist); the left hand (PropL) wraps the cup's other side. halt starts on lf_story_run frame 0; stumble starts on lf_civilian_follow_tired frame 0; hide_hold/peek and collapse_hold/support_hold continue their one-shots. Cloth bones (skirt, cloak, hood, bag) carry thigh-follow secondary motion. Display body = miller LOD0 only."
}